# JDBC thin 11.2 (ojdbc6) making a temporary BLOB (createTemporary, session duration)
# on 9.2.0.4 (#2803): the LOBOPS CREATE_TEMP.
# Captured 2026-11-27 through tools/capture_proxy.py. The TTC payload,
# without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the offset column
# and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  03 60 05 01 01 28 00 01  0a 00 01 71 01 01 01 02  |.`...(.....q....|
00000010  01 10 01 01 01 00 54 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |......T.........|
00000020  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000030  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 01 01 01  |................|
00000040  0a 01 01                                          |...|
00000043
